{"id":90950521756963,"name":"Missile Empire","desc":"🏗️ Build your base. Launch your missiles. Dominate the skies.\n\nStart with an empty plot and a little cash. Place income-generating buildings, stockpile powerful missiles, and grow your empire from the ground up — all while your base earns money even when you're offline.\n\nBut you're not alone. Every player on the server is a potential target.\n\n🚀 Launch missiles at enemy bases to destroy their buildings and collect bounty cash\n🏠 Build and upgrade your base to maximize your income per second\n🛡️ Shield your base from incoming fire and repair what gets destroyed\n💰 Grind your economy or go on the offensive — the choice is yours\n⚔️ Declare war, rack up bounties, and climb to the top\n\nThe richest base doesn't always win. The most ruthless one does.\n🔥 How fast can you rise before someone tries to burn it all down?\n\nTAGS; War, Missile, Tycoon, Nuke, Explode, Missile War, Empire, Rocket","path":"/game/90950521756963-missile-empire","slug":"90950521756963-missile-empire","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4ad59dfce7c8658cb09fdf33bc0731402191c413f9d0af0f872b2c84833c2e38.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bf2709cb52dc3f5b0267ed90a883fde3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":12053548,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-14T09:40:00.556Z","creator":{"name":"#Catalyst Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Missile-Empire-Script-GhostHub-243031","_id":"6a560281646f27c41b2fd7c9","title":"Script GhostHub","game":{"_id":"6a53f91b054d92b84b720a2a","gameId":90950521756963,"name":"Missile Empire","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":90950521756963},"features":"Missile Empire OP script","tags":["Missile Empire","OP"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://api.jnki